                      <SHORT-NAME>SpiCsPolarity</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">ECUC_Spi_00210: This parameter defines the active polarity of Chip Select.</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
