                    <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ed8602ae-8740-4d75-9934-ebac605e6162">
                      <SHORT-NAME>SpiJobEndNotification</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">ECUC_Spi_00218: This parameter is a reference to a notification function. &lt;br/&gt; &lt;h1&gt;Note&lt;/h1&gt; This parameter available only when &apos;SpiLevelDelivered&apos; = 1 or = 2. &lt;br/&gt; Must be a valid C function name or NULL_PTR.</L-2>
                      </DESC>
